        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IWABD, Hammered  Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hammered Knob reflects the decor of early American and European homes, when all hardware was made by a blacksmith. This Acorn made black iron door knob is beautiful and authentic-looking as well.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Rustic Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage Set (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy Set (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior knob engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
